data falsifier_self_host_wet_batch_note: String = "Nightly falsifier batch 2 (Wave 2 CI substrate): the declared Wet lane for emit->compile->run->equals-seed self-host behavioral receipts (v2.compiler.self_host.wet_receipt_enrollment falsifier_self_host_wet_entries — template + frontier-flipped SelfEmitted bindings only; see falsifier_self_host_wet_note in gunbc.ci_layer_roots). Gate-4 std/logic is the inaugural green template; compiler modules enroll when frontier rows flip SelfEmitted with a declared binding — never known-red. Whole-receipt wall budget: gunbc_falsifier_self_host_wet_receipt_wall_budget. Runs SelectionApplied after the hermetic predict-only affected-set sweep; claim_executor halts batch 2 if batch 1 fails (fail-closed). REHOME 2026-07-25: enrollment gated on falsifier_self_host_wet_cadence_is_active (currently false — see falsifier_self_host_wet_cadence_rehome_note); roster retained for local recipe."

