data gunbc_falsifier_native_cache_cold_note: String = "Native-cache cold control plan (widen-only, the compile-clean cold-control pattern): the COLD-VALID roster (falsifier_native_cache_cold_roster — agreement + native_cold legs only, never the full aggregates whose cold_then_warm legs assert the warm-ness this control deliberately destroys), run by the falsifier cold-control step with GUNBC_CI_NATIVE_CACHE_COLD_CONTROL=1 so every .native_ready marker is ignored and the full emit+cargo+run chain executes cold. Can only force MORE work per entry than the warm nightly batch, never less; a warm-poisoned entry (content_verified_on_read=false in extdeps.realization.native_artifact_cache) surfaces here as a cold-vs-warm receipt divergence."

